  "prefLabel": "Ph 1805.03 Disciplinary Action and Sanctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1805.03 Disciplinary Action and Sanctions. The board shall follow Ph 2207 when initiating disciplinary actions action against a licensee or imposing sanctions against a licensee who violates any of the provisions listed in Ph 1805.01\n\nSource. #13463, eff 10-18-22",
